---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="Who I am and what this blog is for."
	pubDate={new Date('August 16 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		I'm Alex Trandafir — a cybersecurity student in Leamington Spa, working my
		way from an HND toward a BSc and a career in Identity and Access Management.
		Chapter87 is where I document that journey in the open.
	</p>

	<p>
		Most of what I write here starts as something I built in my homelab and got
		stuck on: hybrid identity with Active Directory, Okta and Entra; a
		self-hosted AI agent running on my own VPS; wireless security testing on my
		own kit; NAS and network hardening. I'd rather show the work — including the
		parts that broke — than list buzzwords.
	</p>

	<p>
		If you're a recruiter or hiring manager: the posts are the portfolio. Each
		one is a real project with the decisions, the mistakes, and what I'd do
		differently. If you want to talk, the GitHub link in the footer is the
		fastest way to reach me.
	</p>

	<p><em>This page is a starting point — edit it to sound like you.</em></p>
</Layout>
